Something occured to me a few minutes ago, while I was playing NetHack
3.0.9.  My +1 shield rusted down to -2.  Now, I wonder, how badly can
a shield rust, that wearing it makes your AC worse than it was without
the shield.
I think that once an armor has rusted to the point where it does not
change your AC, one more rust should cause it to completely rust away
into dust.  In other words, it should disappear.
Of course this means the game would have to keep track of what part of
the negative was caused by rust and what part by magic.  Does it
already do this?


They say that all the bugs have been eliminated. -more-

